                                                "sense_id": "f5744580-13a9-34da-87bd-303eccf53386",
                                                "text": "Beatrice looked up and saw a man standing before her; the huge sombrero overshadowed his face, but the light of the lamp shone on a large and glittering knife in his girdle."
